@startuml

actor Initiator
participant "LedgerTransaction" as LedgerTransaction
participant "Encumbered State" as EncumberedState
participant "Encumbrance State (Lock/Marker)" as EncumbranceState
participant "Notary" as Notary

== State Issuance ==
Initiator -> LedgerTransaction: Propose creation of Asset State
LedgerTransaction -> EncumbranceState: Create lock/marker
LedgerTransaction -> EncumberedState: Create asset, link encumbrance to lock/marker
LedgerTransaction -> Notary: Request notarization
Notary -> LedgerTransaction: Notarizes transaction

== Attempt to Spend Asset ==
Initiator -> LedgerTransaction: Propose spending Encumbered State
alt Encumbrance not included
LedgerTransaction -> EncumberedState: Encumbrance check fails
LedgerTransaction -> Initiator: Transaction rejected
else Encumbrance included
LedgerTransaction -> EncumberedState: Encumbrance check passes
LedgerTransaction -> EncumbranceState: Consumed with asset
LedgerTransaction -> Notary: Notarizes transaction
Notary -> LedgerTransaction: Transaction finalized
end

@enduml